      Research focuses on the nutritional and flavor quality of fruits, with emphasis on elucidating the biosynthetic regulation, quality evolution, endophyte-driven mechanisms, and health-promoting effects of quality-related bioactive compounds in citrus and other fruits, alongside the development of AI-oriented agricultural databases and intelligent agents for scientific research.
      He has led multiple grants including the NSFC General Program, the NSFC Regional Joint Key Program, the Zhejiang Province San-Nong-Jiu-Fang Program, the Zhejiang Provincial Agricultural Major Technology Collaborative Promotion Program, and the Zhejiang Provincial Key R&D Program.
