    <em>Citrus Flavonoids: Purification, Identification, Biosynthesis and Medical Application</em> [M].
    Zhejiang University Press / Springer, Singapore, 2026. (ISBN 978-981-92-1406-8; DOI: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/978-981-92-1407-5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">10.1007/978-981-92-1407-5</a>)
